1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:12,000
Settings > Instagram in Maya CRM.
No Instagram professional account is connected yet.

2
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:24,000
'Connect with Instagram' opens Instagram Login.
The user grants instagram_business_basic and
instagram_business_manage_messages.

3
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:36,000
instagram_business_basic: Maya shows the connected
account's username, name and profile picture.

4
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:48,000
A customer sends a Direct message to the account
from Instagram (right side).

5
00:00:49,000 --> 00:01:00,000
The message arrives in Maya's inbox (Instagram channel)
with the customer's username.

6
00:01:01,000 --> 00:01:12,000
instagram_business_manage_messages:
the agent replies from Maya and clicks Send.

7
00:01:13,000 --> 00:01:24,000
The reply is delivered in the customer's
Instagram Direct (native client). End of demo.
